# Trial of the Pilgrim (Q215), a second class-change trial, played by a level 36 Cleric
# carrying the 100000 adena Gerald asks for his book, every script roll pinned to 0:
# Santiago starts it, hands over the Voucher of Trial and pays the level 35 set's Dimensional
# Diamonds; Tanapi takes the voucher; Ancestor Martankus sends the cleric after a Lava
# Salamander's Essence of Flame and turns it into the Spirit of Flame; Tanapi, then Gauri
# Twinklerock's Tag of Rumor; Gerald sells his book, Dorf takes the tag for the Gray Badge,
# Gerald buys the book back; Primos, then Petron's Picture of Nahir for Nahir's hair and the
# Statue of Einhasad; Andellia (level 36) sends the cleric after a Black Willow, Uruha trades
# the willow's debris for the Book of Darkness, which Andellia lets the cleric keep; Casian
# takes the four tokens for the Book of Sage; Santiago hands over the Mark of Pilgrim and
# completes the quest; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q215_trial_of_the_pilgrim.golden
character Pilgrim 36
class 15
hold 57 100000
random always 0
